5,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,"I worry we judge by sound, not by the daily losses on the floor.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,May,,We treat staff time as free. Who absorbs the extra work?,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,We promise dates based on conditions we do not control.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,The fund is committed before we know the actual budget source.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Kenji,,We keep rediscovering lessons from earlier winners. Nobody checks the files.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,@May Exactly. The effort is invisible until it breaks.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,May,,@Daisuke Agreed. We need to see the staffing impact clearly.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,@Ryuji The budget source changes what is affordable.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,@Shunichi Yes. The renewal notice often holds the real bill.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Kenji,,@All We should look at past outcomes to avoid repetition.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,I want to see the time lost to copying records.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,May,,I need to check the staffing of the coordination group.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,I will look into network coverage at customer plants.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,I will investigate the capital budget and software allowance.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Kenji,,I will review the outcomes of the last three rollouts.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,"Also, the incident logs for misrouted deliveries seem relevant.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,May,,And the handling of vendor queries might show the load.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,In-house developer availability is also a critical constraint.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,Vendor licence pricing versus fixed-fee work is the other half.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Kenji,,The record of cross-unit standardization efforts is the final piece.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
