40,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,@May That explains the bottleneck. The effort is real.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,May,,@Daisuke Yes. The vendor queries are repetitive and slow.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
