46,2,3,talk,May,,The clerks request the same certificates repeatedly.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Shunichi,,The developers are committed to the accounting upgrade.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Ryuji,,The outside integrator left interfaces undocumented.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Kenji,,Four standardization efforts ended without an owner.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Daisuke,,We need to fix the data duplication first.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,May,,The staffing issue is critical for any new tool.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Shunichi,,Network coverage is a major risk for mobile apps.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Ryuji,,We should avoid per-head licence models.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Kenji,,We must ensure the tool has a clear owner.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
